        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "text": "Siddharth, floor meeda kurchoni with a pad on his lap. There are different pencils, an eraser, a sharpener, a whole unit of box a side, all placed on the floor randomly, as he's sketching some cartoon character. Comic sketches on A4 sheets placed on one another with numbers visible at the bottom right circled.",
