          "line_start": 108
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "text": "A guy walks with random foot steps, and lands his foot on one of the A4 papers. Siddharth immediately looks at that feet with a shock, the guy picks up that paper with his toe, Siddharth looks up to him.",
          "character": null,
          "line_start": 110
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "text": "Holding that paper in front of his face, burns a comic character's face, his single eye is visible through the hole made by that cigar's burn. With a side smile, releases smoke, his face through an X mark which is being made on the paper is visible. And that paper is dropped, revealing his face. As he releases smokes, it's Rahul.",
          "character": null,
          "line_start": 112
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "text": "Rahul will be on his bed, as he takes a puff, Sidhu looks at him, takes big puff, as he slants on the pillow, throws that cigar at Sidhu. Sidhu moves a side, 1-2 sparks fell over here and there, he covers his face, looks at him, as he looks around, the cigar's ash being fell over those few sheets of comic sketches and a hole is made on all those sheets.",
          "character": null,
          "line_start": 114
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "text": "As Siddhu looks at him with a teary eyes,",
